      "Text": "Security update for openexr",
      "Title": "Topic",
      "Type": "Summary"
    },
    {
      "Text": "This update for openexr fixes the following issue:\n\n- CVE-2026-88384: NULL pointer dereference in the C++ attribute parsing path when a specially crafted EXR file\n  containing an unknown-type attribute with dataSize set to zero is processed (bsc#1282700).\n",
